          https://www.newgeneralservicelist.com/new-academic-word-list
          https://www.newgeneralservicelist.com/s/NAWL_12_lemmatized_for_teaching.csv

Downloaded on 2026-10-26. The two files are included UNCHANGED, byte for byte (the repository
marks them `-text` in .gitattributes so that Git never rewrites their line endings). Every
adjustment (the spreadsheet artefacts `TRUE` and `FALSE` in the NGSL, the ISO-8859-1 encoding of
the NAWL) is made when the application reads them, never in the files.

